"DATA","ID303A","2.00","3.00","Stiff to very stiff mottled grey brown and orange, slightly sandy, slightly gravelly silty CLAY with high cobble content. Sand is fine to coarse. Gravel is fine to coarse angular to subangular of mixed lithologies predominantly chalk and flint. Occasional rootlets and gypsum crystals. Rare lignite. Cobbles are subangular of chalk ","211","GT-C","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID304","0.00","0.40","Brown slightly gravelly silty CLAY. Gravel is fine to coarse of flint. (TOPSOIL)","101","TS","","","","","","",""
