"DATA","ID310","4.57","7.45","Stiff to very stiff grey CLAY with occasional pockets of silty clay and occasional black coarse sand sized nodular and tabular fossils (possibly coral). Subvertical fissures, planar, incipient occasionally with light brown staining on surfaces 10 to 50 degree fissures, closely spaced, planar, incipient.","202","OC","","","","","","",""
