"DATA","ID372","15.30","18.00","Very stiff dark brownish grey slightly gravelly silty CLAY. Gravel is fine to coarse subangular to subrounded of mixed lithologies predominantly chalk and flint. Rare tabular 10mm fossils possibly coral. Discontinuities: 1. 10 to 30 degree fissures, closely spaced, planar, smooth, closed. 2. Subvertical fissures, planar, smooth, closed.			  ","208","GT-C","","","","","","",""
