"DATA","ID408","6.50","10.00","Stiff to very stiff thinly laminated dark grey silty CLAY with rare coarse rounded gravel of mudstone from 6.50 to 6.60m. Moderate fossil content of shell fragments, ammonites and bivalves. Occasional 5 to 20mm pockets of fine to coarse sand sized pyrite.  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 30 degree fissures very closely spaced undulating smooth incipient.   Discontinuity Set 2: 70 to 90 degree fissures undulating smooth incipient.   Discontinuity Set 3: From 8.50m subvertical shears, planar smooth incipient. ","202","KIM","","","","","","",""
