"DATA","ID425","0.60","8.60","Firm to stiff light grey mottled brownish orange silty CLAY with occasional thin lenses of white and translucent gypsum crystals. Becoming grey with occasional orange staining on fissure surfaces below approximately 4.20m with belemnites and occasional fine to coarse gravel sized phosphate nodules. Occasional fossil fragments of shells probably of bivalves. ","202","GLT","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID425","8.60","13.30","Stiff to very stiff greenish grey mottled brownish grey in parts silty CLAY with occasional fine to coarse gravel sized phosphate nodules and fossils of shell fragments probably of bivalves and ammonites. Rare off white tabular fossil 3mm to 10mm in length possibly coral. Discontinuity Set 1: Subhorizontal fissures very closely spaced, planar, smooth incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subhorizontal fissures stepped rough, incipient. Discontinuity Set 3: 30 to 60 degree fissures closely spaced, planar, occasionally undulating smooth incipient. Discontinuity Set 4: Subvertical shears, planar, occasionally undulating polished, incipient.","202","GLT","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID425","13.30","18.40","Stiff to very stiff dark grey occasionally mottled brownish grey and speckled light brown silty CLAY. Occasional fossils of shell fragments and belemnites. Rare fine to coarse gravel sized phosphate nodules fossils occasionally pyritized.  Discontinuity Set 1: Subhorizontal fissures closely spaced undulating, smooth incipient. Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical shear typically planar, occasionally undulating polished incipient. Discontinuity Set 3: Subhorizontal shears, medium spaced, planar, polished, incipient. ","202","GLT","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID425","18.40","19.04","Very stiff dark grey slightly sandy CLAY. Sand is fine to coarse, sand content increasing with depth occasional fossils of shell fragments of ammonites and bivalves rare coarse gravel if phosphate. Discontinuity Set 1: Subhorizontal fissures closely spaced, planar, smooth incipient.","203","GLT","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID425","19.04","19.55","Very dense dark greenish grey mottled brown and orange gravelly very clayey fine to coarse SAND. Gravel is fine to coarse subrounded of mixed lithologies predominantly sandstone. ","410","LG","","","","","","",""
