"DATA","ID711","20.30","21.30","Very stiff greenish grey silty CLAY with moderate to high fossil content consisting of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments, bivalves and ammonites occasionally pyritized.  Discontinuity Set 1. 0 to 10 degree fissures closely spaced planar smooth incipient. ","202","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","21.30","22.34","Very stiff greenish grey silty CLAY Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 30 degree fissures very closely spaced planar smooth incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: 50 to 80 degree shears, very closely spaced, undulating polished incipient.  Discontinuity Set 3: Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient ","202","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","22.34","23.30","Very stiff greenish grey silty CLAY with low fossil content consisting of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments and bivalves. Thickly laminated in places.  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 10 degree fissures closely spaced planar smooth incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical shears planar polished incipient.","202","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","23.30","26.58","Very stiff greenish grey silty CLAY with low fossil content of 1mm to 20mm shell fragments and bivalves.  Discontinuity Set 1: Subvertical shears planar polished incipient Discontinuity Set 2: Subhorizontal shears closely spaced undulating polished incipient. Discontinuity Set 3: 30 to 60 degree shears closely spaced undulating polished incipient","201","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","26.58","27.69","Very stiff greenish grey silty CLAY with low fossil content of 1mm to 5mm shell fragments bivalves and ammonites  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 10 degree fissures medium spaced, planar smooth incipient. ","201","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","27.69","29.03","Very stiff dark greenish grey slightly sandy silty CLAY. Sand is fine to coarse.  Discontinuity Set 1: Subhorizontal fissures closely spaced planar rough incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical shears planar polished incipient.","207","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","29.03","30.69","Very dense greenish grey clayey fine to coarse SAND. Low fossil content with trace shell fragments and bivalves. Rare off white 4mm banding. ","401","KLS","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","30.69","32.83","Very stiff dark grey slightly sandy silty CLAY. Low fossil content of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments. Occasional pockets of light grey sand with pyrite.  Discontinuity Set 1: Subhorizontal fissures closely spaced planar smooth incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient.","201","KLC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","32.83","33.20","Weak dark grey poorly cemented SANDSTONE. White veining possibly calcite. 1mm to 30mm shell fragments. Fine to coarse sand sized pyrite grains.","803","CB","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","33.20","33.80","Extremely weak green and off white LIMESTONE. Pockets of fine to coarse sand sized pyrite and occasional 1mm to 10mm shell fragments. Green colour possibly due to glauconite. ","804","BWC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","33.80","34.63","Medium strong grey LIMESTONE with moderate to high fossil content of 1mm to 30mm white shell fragments. Discontinuity Set 1:  Subhorizontal joints medium spaced undulating rough closed.","804","BWL","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","34.63","34.95","Extremely weak dark grey LIMESTONE. High fossil content of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments. ","804","BWL","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","34.95","39.68","Medium strong grey LIMESTONE with high fossil content of shell fragments.  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 10 degree joints typically medium spaced, occasionally closely spaced undulating rough closed, occasionally open with 1mm to 10mm clayey fill","804","BWL","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","39.68","40.74","Very weak dark greenish grey SILTSTONE with moderate to high fossil content of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments and bivalves. Rare 10mm to 30mm black lignite fragments.  Discontinuity Set 1: 40.45m to 40.60m - One subvertical joint planar smooth incipient. ","802","RLD","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","40.74","40.97","Very stiff dark greenish grey and black silty CLAY (extremely weak MUDSTONE)  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 30 degree fissures very closely spaced undulating smooth incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient. Discontinuity Set 3: Possible subvertical shears planar polished incipient. ","801","RLD","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","40.97","41.46","Very stiff dark green SILT. Moderate fossil content of 1mm to 5mm shell fragments and rare 10mm to 30mm pockets of black lignite (extremely weak SILTSTONE).  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 30 degree fissures very closely spaced planar rough incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient.","301","RLD","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","41.46","42.59","Very stiff dark green CLAY with high fossil content of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments and bivalves. (extremely weak CLAYSTONE)","201","RLD","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID711","42.59","45.00","Very stiff dark brown silty CLAY with occasional 1mm to 3mm layers of light brown fine sand on fissures surfaces. Low to moderate fossil content of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments and bivalves. Occasional fine to coarse gravel sized pyrite nodules. Occasional patchy black staining (extremely weak MUDSTONE)  Discontinuity Set 1: 0 to 20 degree fissures very closely spaced undulating rough incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical fissures undulating rough open with 1mm to 3mm sandy fill","202","RLD","","","","","","",""
