"DATA","ID712","24.50","27.30","Very stiff greenish grey silty CLAY with low fossil content of 1mm to 10mm shell fragments ammonites brachiopods Discontinuity Set 1:  0 to 30 degree fissures very closely spaced stepped rough incipient. Discontinuity Set 2:  60 to 80 degree shears medium spaced becoming closely spaced below 26.10m typically undulating occasionally planar polished closed. Discontinuity Set 3: Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient","202","OC","","","","","","",""
"DATA","ID712","27.30","29.74","Very stiff dark brownish grey and dark greenish grey silty CLAY with moderate fossil content of 1mm to 20mm shell fragments ammonites bivalves brachiopods and belmnites. Discontinuity Set 1:  0 to 30 degree fissures closely spaced undulating rough incipient. Discontinuity Set 2:  Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient.","202","OC","","","","","","",""
