"DATA","ID712","31.80","33.75","Very stiff dark grey silty CLAY with low fossil content of 1mm to 5mm shell fragments occasionally stained light brown.  Discontinuity Set 1: Subhorizontal fissures closely spaced planar smooth incipient.  Discontinuity Set 2: Subvertical fissures planar smooth incipient. ","202","KLC","","","","","","",""
